# The story: Thursday after school (the classroom, or the roof), Thursday night on the phone, and Friday night at the
# festival, where it ends one of four ways. Each choice raises someone's love (or doesn't); the festival's choice opens
# what love has earned.

# Thursday after school: cleaning up with Kaede, if you stayed.
scene cleanup
    time Thursday 16:20
    show classroom as background
    "Everyone else left. Kaede handed me a broom like it was a sword."
    show kaede annoyed with fade_in
    Kaede annoyed: Desks first. Then the floor. Then the windows. Then we talk about the lanterns.
    Kaede calm: Do you know how many lanterns this class is hanging tomorrow? Forty.
    Kaede: Forty lanterns, and I wrote every name on every one.
    choice
        "Is mine on one?"
            set kaede.love to kaede.love + 1
            Kaede surprised: W-why would yours be on one?!
            Kaede flustered: ...It's on the one by the bridge. For no reason.
        "Forty? You didn't have to do that alone."
            set kaede.love to kaede.love + 1
            Kaede sad: Nobody else offered.
            Kaede smile: ...You're offering now, though. Late, but fine.
        "Can we hurry this up?"
            Kaede cold: Sure. Leave. I'll finish.
            Kaede annoyed: ...I always do.
    "We finished as the sun started going gold. She didn't say thank you. She did walk me to the door."
    hide kaede
    jump gate

# Thursday, the path home under the cherry trees, where Mika waited.
scene gate
    time Thursday 17:10
    show gate as background with fade_in
    weather petals
    show mika smile with fade_in
    if helping is "kaede"
        Mika happy: There you are! I waited right here the whole time ♡
        Mika smile: Kaede kept you for an hour and seven minutes. I counted.
    else if helping is "haru"
        Mika happy: You're walking home with me first, right? Haru-senpai can have you after ♡
    else
        Mika happy: You came! I knew you would ♡
    Mika: The petals are so pretty this year... they fall on everyone the same.
    Mika: Hey, hey. Who are you going to the festival with?
    choice
        "With you, Mika."
            set mika.love to mika.love + 2
            show mika close_flustered with hop
            Mika close_flustered: R-really?! I'll wear my best yukata! Don't you {bold}dare{/bold} change your mind ♡
        "I haven't decided yet."
            set mika.love to mika.love + 1
            Mika cold: ...Haven't decided?
            Mika smile: That's okay. I'll help you decide ♡
        "Probably with Kaede."
            set mika_jealous to yes
            Mika shocked: ...Kaede?
            effect glitch for 0.2 seconds
            play glitch_rewind
            Mika smile: Haha. You're so funny, {name}.
    "Kaede walked past us without a word. Her ears were red."
    Mika: Bye bye, Kaede~ ♡
    hide mika
    stop weather fade=2
    if helping is "haru"
        jump roof_work
    jump night

# Thursday evening: hanging lanterns on the roof with Haru, if you said you would.
scene roof_work
    time Thursday 19:00
    show rooftop as background with fade_in
    "Haru's message just said: roof. now. bring gloves."
    "I didn't bring gloves. The roof was strung with wire and stacks of paper lanterns, and the town below was starting to glow."
    show haru calm with fade_in
    Haru: Hook it through the top. Gently. They tear.
    "Mine tore."
    Haru: ...It's fine. The first one always tears.
    Haru smile: Mine did too. Three years ago.
    choice
        "Is that why you asked me? So I'd tear one too?"
            set haru.love to haru.love + 1
            Haru smile: ...Maybe I just wanted company.
        "You've done this for three years? Alone?"
            set haru.love to haru.love + 1
            Haru sad: Nobody else volunteers.
            Haru calm: Tomorrow they'll all look up and think the lanterns grew there.
        "Can I go home now?"
            Haru cold: ...Sure. Mind the stairs.
    "We hung forty-one. He counted the torn one."
    Haru: From up here you can see the whole festival. Tomorrow, I mean.
    Haru: ...Just so you know.
    hide haru
    jump night

# Thursday night: the phone.
scene night
    time Thursday 21:30
    show bedroom as background with fade_in
    play music/moonlight as music fade=2
    "Home. My phone hasn't stopped buzzing."
    chat Haru
        Haru: {name}.
        Haru is typing for 2 seconds
        Haru: tomorrow. lanterns first, or food?
        choice
            "lanterns first"
                set haru.love to haru.love + 1
                Haru: good answer.
                Haru reacts ♡
            "food, obviously"
                Haru: ...fine. i'm buying.
    "Then Kaede, who never texts anyone."
    chat Kaede
        Kaede is typing for 3 seconds
        Kaede: it's not like i want to go with you or anything
        Kaede deletes it
        Kaede is typing for 2 seconds
        Kaede: the bridge. 7pm. if you're late i'm leaving.
        choice
            "i'll be there ♡"
                set kaede.love to kaede.love + 2
                set promised_kaede to yes
                Kaede: idiot.
                Kaede edits it: ...ok.
            "is that a date?"
                set kaede.love to kaede.love + 1
                Kaede: NO
                Kaede: ...maybe
    "And then Mika called."
    phone call Mika for 8 seconds
        set answered_mika to yes
        set mika.love to mika.love + 1
        set persistent.achievement.picked_up to yes
        Mika: You picked up! I knew you would ♡
        Mika: I just wanted to hear your voice before I sleep.
        Mika: Did you know your street has eleven lanterns already? I counted them on my way past.
        Mika: Goodnight, {name}. See you tomorrow. I'll find you, wherever you are ♡
        missed:
            chat Mika
                Mika: why didn't you answer?
                Mika: you're still awake. your light is on ♡
                Mika: it's okay. i'll see you tomorrow ♡
    "I fell asleep thinking about lanterns."
    stop music fade=2
    jump festival

# Friday night: the festival.
scene festival
    time Friday 19:00 day=2
    show festival as background with fade_in
    play music/festival as music fade=2
    weather petals amount=60%
    "Friday night. The lanterns came on all at once, and the whole street turned gold."
    "There were stalls the whole way to the shrine: candy apples, goldfish in paper bowls, a man selling wishes on strips of paper."
    "I wrote one. I didn't let anyone see it."
    "Somewhere ahead, a red ribbon in a ponytail. Somewhere above, a light on the school roof. And somewhere behind me, footsteps that matched mine exactly."
    "Kaede said the bridge. Haru said the roof. Mika said she'd find me."
    choice for 8 seconds
        "Find Kaede at the bridge" (needs kaede.love is at least 3: Kaede didn't ask)
            jump kaede_ending
        "Go up to the roof, to Haru" (needs haru.love is at least 2: Haru didn't ask)
            jump haru_ending
        "Wait for Mika"
            jump mika_ending
    "I didn't move. I didn't have to."
    jump mika_ending

# Kaede's ending.
scene kaede_ending
    show festival as background
    "The bridge was the brightest place in town. Forty lanterns, one name on each."
    show kaede annoyed with fade_in
    if not promised_kaede
        set persistent.achievement.late to yes
        Kaede annoyed: You're late. Two minutes late.
        Kaede: I was about to leave. I really was.
    else
        Kaede surprised: You came. You actually came.
        Kaede annoyed: I mean. Obviously you came. You said you would.
    Kaede calm: That one's yours. By the bridge. I told you, for no reason.
    Kaede calm: The lanterns are pretty. That's all I wanted to say.
    show kaede close_flustered with hop
    Kaede close_flustered: ...No, it isn't.
    camera with shake
    Kaede close_flustered: {bold}I like you,{/bold} okay?! Don't make that face!
    Kaede close_flustered: I've liked you since you forgot your homework in April and copied mine and got it all wrong anyway!
    hide kaede
    show gallery/kaede_lanterns as background with fade_in
    "Under the lanterns, the class president held my hand all the way home. So I wouldn't get lost, she said."
    set persistent.ending.kaede to yes
    jump the_end

# Haru's ending.
scene haru_ending
    time Friday 19:20
    show rooftop as background with fade_in
    stop weather fade=1
    "The stairs to the roof were dark. The door at the top was propped open with a torn paper lantern."
    show haru calm with fade_in
    Haru: You came.
    Haru: From up here, the whole festival looks like one lantern.
    Haru smile: Forty-one of them are ours.
    show haru close_flustered with hop
    Haru close_flustered: ...I didn't need help with the lanterns.
    Haru close_flustered: I just wanted you up here. With me.
    Haru close_flustered: Three years I watched it alone. This year I wanted to watch it with someone I— with you.
    hide haru
    show gallery/haru_rooftop as background with fade_in
    "We watched the lanterns until the last one went out. He didn't let go of my hand once."
    set persistent.ending.haru to yes
    jump the_end

# Mika's ending, or the other one.
scene mika_ending
    if not answered_mika or mika_jealous
        jump only_you
    show festival as background
    "A hand slipped into mine. I knew whose before I turned."
    show mika happy with fade_in
    Mika happy: Found you ♡
    Mika smile: I told you I'd find you, wherever you were.
    Mika smile: I counted every lantern on the way here. Two thousand and twelve. But I only wanted to see this one.
    show mika close_smile with hop
    Mika close_smile: Can I hold your hand? Just for tonight.
    Mika close_smile: ...And tomorrow night. And every night after that ♡
    hide mika
    show gallery/mika_promise as background with fade_in
    "Mika laughed and pulled me into the crowd, under a thousand lanterns."
    set persistent.ending.mika to yes
    jump the_end

scene only_you
    stop music fade=0.5
    stop weather
    effect glitch for 0.4 seconds
    play glitch_crush
    show rooftop_red as background
    play music/only_you as music fade=2
    "The lanterns went out. All of them, at once."
    show mika cold with fade_in
    Mika cold: You didn't answer, {name}.
    Mika: I called and called. Eight seconds is a long time, when you're waiting.
    play heartbeat loop=yes
    show mika cold animation=heartbeat
    Mika: So I came to you instead ♡
    Mika: Kaede's waiting at the bridge. Haru's waiting on the roof. They'll wait a long time.
    camera with shake
    Mika cold: The festival's over. It's just you and me now.
    stop heartbeat
    hide mika
    show gallery/mika_only_you as background with fade_in
    "{colour #ff3a4a}{bold}BAD END{/bold}{/colour}: Only you"
    set persistent.ending.only_you to yes
    jump the_end

# Every ending: what it earned, then the credits; the story ends, and it's back to the title.
scene the_end
    set persistent.achievement.first_lantern to yes
    if endings_reached is 4
        set persistent.achievement.every_lantern to yes
    stop music fade=3
    open credits
